WHY THE DATA IS NON-COMMERCIAL
------------------------------
1,019 of the reference riddles are derived from CC-Riddle, released by Fan Xu,
Yunxiang Zhang and Xiaojun Wan under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. We selected, reorganized
and augmented that corpus, so the ShareAlike condition applies. Redistribution
of the data requires the same license, attribution to the upstream authors,
and a notice that changes were made.

CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 is NOT an OSI-approved open-source license. Please describe
this dataset as "publicly released under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0", not as "open
source". Making this repository freely available is itself a NonCommercial
act under §1; the restriction applies to downstream commercial use.

The MIT and CC BY 4.0 notices are separate and apply only to their respective
directories; they do not relicense the data.

This notice is provided for information and is not legal advice.
